{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JgAjbTSUomS3jKCeLM5trG","type":"tool_result","content":"CHANGELOG.md:129:- `_python-hook.sh` exports `CEO_HOOK_BOUNDED_EXIT=1`. A hook that runs\n.claude/hooks/_python-hook.sh:410:export CEO_HOOK_BOUNDED_EXIT=1\n.claude/plans/PLAN-198/CONDITIONS-rc1.md:31:8. **Um hook registrado deixa pendente, na saída, o trabalho do spool de auditoria, e a cura é parcial.** O `.claude/hooks/_python-hook.sh` exporta `CEO_HOOK_BOUNDED_EXIT=1`; o ADR-055-AMEND-4 está `ACCEPTED` com a implementação `PARTIAL`, e o Known-open do CHANGELOG [1.4.4] declara que não está provado que todo evento pulado seja coletado depois, sem release atribuída à cura.\n.claude/hooks/_lib/spool_writer.py:515:def set_exit_deadline(deadline_monotonic: Optional[float]) -> None:\n.claude/hooks/_lib/spool_writer.py:528:def _exit_deadline_active() -> bool:\n.claude/hooks/_lib/spool_writer.py:530:    return _EXIT_DEADLINE_MONOTONIC is not None or os.environ.get(\"CEO_HOOK_BOUNDED_EXIT\") == \"1\"\n.claude/hooks/_lib/spool_writer.py:531:def _record_exit_deadline_skip(source: str) -> None:\n.claude/plans/PLAN-198/relmeta-approved.md:194:[Omitted long matching line]\n.claude/hooks/_lib/_spool_writer_parts/lifecycle.py:348:    if _exit_deadline_active():\n.claude/hooks/_lib/_spool_writer_parts/lifecycle.py:349:        _record_exit_deadline_skip(\"atexit\")\n.claude/hooks/_lib/_spool_writer_parts/lifecycle.py:365:    elif _exit_deadline_active():\n.claude/hooks/_lib/_spool_writer_parts/lifecycle.py:366:        _record_exit_deadline_skip(f\"signal-{signum}\")\n.claude/plans/PLAN-198/relmeta/apply-relmeta144-edits.py:205:BOUNDED_EXIT_LINE = \"export CEO_HOOK_BOUNDED_EXIT=1\"\n.claude/plans/PLAN-198/relmeta/apply-relmeta144-edits.py:1313:    if sw and (\"CEO_HOOK_BOUNDED_EXIT\" not in sw or \"exit_deadline_skip\" not in sw):\n.claude/plans/PLAN-198/relmeta/apply-relmeta144-edits.py:1314:        bad.append(\"%s nao le CEO_HOOK_BOUNDED_EXIT nem grava